   "title": "치환",
   "text": "$x=\\sqrt{3}\\tan \\theta$ $\\left(0 \\le \\theta \\le \\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right)$ 로 치환하면 $dx=\\sqrt{3}\\frac{1}{\\cos^{2}\\theta}d \\theta$ , $3+x^{2}=\\frac{3}{\\cos^{2}\\theta}$ 이므로 $$\\int_{0}^{3}\\frac{\\ln(1+x)}{3+x^{2}}dx=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{3}}\\ln \\left(1+\\sqrt{3}\\tan \\theta \\right)d \\theta$$",
   "uses": [
    "C2"
   ]
